      ],
      "text": "A plan document proposes memory nodes (memory_write/memory_retrieve) backed by local agent_memory tables and Doubao-embedding-vision embeddings, with workflow/user/global scopes and explicit (not automatic) memory writes."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ece923b61180a4ba6cddd106e87561664de24b4fde9a97fa055feb261cae51cf",
