      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a7868f1edf43cd05da240d300da985319da3144df6ccc26610a3e0f92d5e2450"
      ],
      "text": "The Agent Plan integration plan specifies new node types: web_search/web_fetch, memory_write/memory_retrieve, image_generate/video_generate/vision_analyze, and knowledge_upsert/knowledge_retrieve, also registrable as ReAct Agent tools."
    },
